```console
$ scherzo-cloud account --help
Manage your Scherzo Cloud account

Usage: scherzo-cloud account [COMMAND]

Commands:
  deletion  Manage your account deletion schedule
  signup    Create your Scherzo Cloud account
  update    Update your Scherzo Cloud account
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
